{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01467",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 2.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.93,
      "end_seconds": 9.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.98,
      "end_seconds": 18.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "Actually, I wanted to get pain in the lower right tummy looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.08,
      "end_seconds": 22.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.83,
      "end_seconds": 35.13,
      "duration_seconds": 11.3,
      "text": "It's been two weeks now. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.36,
      "end_seconds": 39.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.48,
      "end_seconds": 58.74,
      "duration_seconds": 14.26,
      "text": "A three out of ten, I suppose. Oh, and no appetite. Oh, um, and a low fever. That's been about the same, about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.15,
      "end_seconds": 71.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.96,
      "end_seconds": 76.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.38,
      "end_seconds": 84.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.12,
      "end_seconds": 93.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "I had part of my thyroid removed years back. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.31,
      "end_seconds": 97.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.17,
      "end_seconds": 103.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Yes, grass pollen, it gives me sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.81,
      "end_seconds": 117.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.06,
      "end_seconds": 126.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "text": "I've had eczema for two years now. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.2,
      "end_seconds": 140.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "So, yes, eczema is known to us, good to have that clear. What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.36,
      "end_seconds": 145.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.88,
      "end_seconds": 147.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.21,
      "end_seconds": 151.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.84,
      "end_seconds": 153.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.36,
      "end_seconds": 158.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.99,
      "end_seconds": 165.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "A few quick ones: jaundice, constipation, hernia bulge or burning when passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.31,
      "end_seconds": 169.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.89,
      "end_seconds": 173.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Did you notice any diarrhoea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.83,
      "end_seconds": 175.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Nope, no diarrhoea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.83,
      "end_seconds": 180.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Alright, is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.19,
      "end_seconds": 185.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Nothing there, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.14,
      "end_seconds": 197.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.91,
      "end_seconds": 206.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.69,
      "end_seconds": 228.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "Okay: temp 39.2 degrees, BP is 119 over 72, pulse 95. And oxygen saturation is 95 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.31,
      "end_seconds": 234.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.22,
      "end_seconds": 237.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.49,
      "end_seconds": 250.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Bowel sounds are present."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.29,
      "end_seconds": 253.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.75,
      "end_seconds": 273.47,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "There's tenderness in the right lower part and it hurts when I let go suddenly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.23,
      "end_seconds": 276.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.0,
      "end_seconds": 317.19,
      "duration_seconds": 35.19,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Let's get blood tests, for abdominal pain. Let's get a urine test, for abdominal pain. Please don't eat or drink anything until the surgeons have seen you. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. I'd like you to see the surgical team as well, and I'll write the referral. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the pain gets sharper or spreads across the tummy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.96,
      "end_seconds": 320.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Thank you, that's clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.47,
      "end_seconds": 328.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "I'd like you back today after the results. Alright, does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.71,
      "end_seconds": 334.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}